      <div class="rec-body">
        <h4>Expand the OfficeProducts Catalog — Best Rating, Lowest Discount Pressure</h4>
        <p>OfficeProducts is the highest-rated category at 4.31 stars and operates at the lowest average discount of just 12.4% — meaning it delivers superior customer satisfaction without margin erosion. With only 31 products today it is significantly underrepresented relative to its quality profile. Expanding this category through curated assortment additions represents the best risk-adjusted growth opportunity in the catalog.</p>
        <span class="rec-evidence">Data: OfficeProducts avg rating 4.31 (#1), avg discount 12.4% (lowest), product count 31 (vs. 448–526 for core categories)</span>
